0168099_8388064315214783389_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MbEaTe4brxsQ7kNvwFgQJkS&_nc_oc=Adq4NrGWEyPsba3jHgdg5N4esXFbgv5H6cf-GGMNSmOJLyMxuWgR5eHM8Fy_Npg-UHo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO_Qu0Q5FxSLhuXESIsxH1oqFkhc5m_1_0AeRFF7qN-vg&oe=6AE200F8"}, {"file_name": "HT_Screens_2560x1440_5.png", "id": "1051261709402320", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_1051261712735653_3438541724928627709_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HsB4TmsZ688Q7kNvwHcAPBF&_nc_oc=AdrQsygA8NFIE8ItStI458fGGGK13KzAQFCwXPrqyOr2oHBJLbJQMG9oosBnVXTQTUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMAgaWAyNxAHcKP6vrrv7svixhyclSlAxVORmPGrV0NCQ&oe=6AE20CBC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hunt Together KeyArt_Video Cover 2560x1440.png", "id": "859547265899781", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031500_859547269233114_6874294734507533955_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PpEDn0pgDTEQ7kNvwFnTDEf&_nc_oc=AdqwShwQhz1clkRweCIBxF8Kgoiso01jCBi14dx3SNxWfbK22CdEc6j-Cyo51XPtWnc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP5uGT_w8wQFHZvM1cVJAtVApOuukUioWYipMUO8tR6rA&oe=6AE1EAEC"}, "display_name": "Hunt Together", "keywords": ["Horror", "PVP", "Action", "Multiplayer", "Online"], "long_description": "Challenge your friends in a PvP VR Horror game (with Meta Quest x PCVR crossplay)! \ud83d\udc7b\n\nFeel the thrill of a hunt in a 1v1 Duel or up to 1v3 Hide and Seek mode that will push your wits, perceptiveness, and courage to their very limits \ud83d\ude31 Employ a wide array of items, triggers, and skills tailored to your class to outsmart and defeat your adversary - a terrifying, lifeforce-draining Ghost or a dauntless, vigilant Hunter. All of this set in spine-chilling locations such as a haunted Mansion, Mines, or a horrid Orphanage.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Challenge your friends in a spooky horr